---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../lib/site';
---
<Base title="About" description="About Bách Nguyễn - a developer who loves technology, books and coffee, writing from Hanoi, Vietnam.">
  <div class="container narrow">
    <header class="about-head">
      <div class="about-photo"><img src={SITE.avatar} alt={`${SITE.name} - profile photo`} width="768" height="768" /></div>
      <div>
        <h1>~/about</h1>
        <p class="about-name">{SITE.name} <span>({SITE.altName})</span></p>
        <p class="about-sub">A developer who loves technology, books and coffee.</p>
        <p class="about-loc">📍 {SITE.location}</p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <article class="prose panel">
      <p>Hi, I'm <strong>Bách Nguyễn</strong> - some friends call me <em>Mr. Robot</em> - and I'm the author of this blog.
      I'm glad you're curious about the journey behind it.</p>

      <h2>About this blog</h2>
      <p>I write here to keep, and to share, the knowledge I pick up along the way. It covers
      <strong>technology</strong>, <strong>cryptography</strong>, <strong>programming</strong>, <strong>IT systems</strong>
      - security, system administration and Linux in particular - and now and then, a few random things that don't fit anywhere else.</p>

      <h2>About me</h2>
      <p>I was born and raised in <strong>Hung Yen Province</strong>, in the area that used to be the old <strong>Thai Binh Province</strong>.
      It's an agricultural region about 100 km south-east of Hanoi.
      Our local specialty is poverty, and endless rice fields where the storks fly and fly without ever finding a place to land.</p>
      <p>I went to <strong>Hung Nhan High School</strong>, probably the coolest school in my hometown and the one everybody
      dreams of getting into. Besides its excellent teachers, it's famous for plenty of good-looking students.</p>
      <p>In my final year I made a hard decision: I chose the military, and chose to study <strong>Information Technology</strong>
      at the <a href="https://mta.edu.vn/"><strong>Military Technical Academy</strong></a> (MTA). It wasn't easy, but I'm always happy and proud that I made it.</p>

      <h2>Beyond the keyboard</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Books.</strong> Reading is one of my favorite ways to learn, and a big part of how this blog gets written.</li>
        <li><strong>Coffee.</strong> I can't say exactly when it started - probably while I was studying for the high school entrance exams,
        when coffee helped me focus and fight off sleepiness. Today I drink it every day: morning, afternoon, and sometimes late at night.</li>
        <li><strong>Volleyball.</strong> I'm no national star, but at my workplace I'm ranked in the top ten.
        Standing 1.74 m tall, I'm the terror of every blocker.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Email: <a href="mailto:bachns@outlook.com">bachns@outlook.com</a></li>
        <li>Telegram: <a href="https://t.me/bachns">@bachns</a></li>
        <li>RSS: <a href="/rss.xml">/rss.xml</a></li>
      </ul>
    </article>
  </div>
</Base>
